List of 17 additional files
   1 dssr-stems.pdb -- an ensemble of stems
   2 dssr-helices.pdb -- an ensemble of helices (coaxial stacking)
   3 dssr-pairs.pdb -- an ensemble of base pairs
   4 dssr-multiplets.pdb -- an ensemble of multiplets
   5 dssr-hairpins.pdb -- an ensemble of hairpin loops
   6 dssr-bulges.pdb -- an ensemble of bulges
   7 dssr-iloops.pdb -- an ensemble of internal loops
   8 dssr-junctions.pdb -- an ensemble of junctions (multi-branch)
   9 dssr-2ndstrs.bpseq -- secondary structure in bpseq format
  10 dssr-2ndstrs.ct -- secondary structure in connectivity table format
  11 dssr-2ndstrs.dbn -- secondary structure in dot-bracket notation
  12 dssr-torsions.txt -- backbone torsion angles and suite names
  13 dssr-splays.pdb -- an ensemble of splayed-apart units
  14 dssr-Aminors.pdb -- an ensemble of A minor motifs (types I and II)
  15 dssr-Kturns.pdb -- an ensemble of kink-turn motifs
  16 dssr-stacks.pdb -- an ensemble of stacks
  17 dssr-atom2bases.pdb -- an ensemble of atom-base stacking interactions

